,insp_anim_min:`Fastest (s)`,insp_anim_ref_power:`Reference value`,insp_anim_ref_power_hint:`The value at which the dots move at normal speed. Twice as much is twice as fast.`,insp_animation:`Animation`,insp_appearance:`Appearance`,insp_auto:`automatic`,insp_background:`Background`,insp_badge:`Value`,insp_badge_label:`Prefix`,insp_badge_true:`Text for true`,insp_badge_false:`Text for false`,insp_badges:`Additional values`,insp_basics:`Basics`,insp_bend_hint:`Where both ends leave in the same direction, the middle piece of the line can be dragged on the canvas. A double click puts it back in the middle.`,insp_canvas:`Canvas`,insp_canvas_hint:`The diagram is scaled into the widget, so these are proportions rather than pixels.`,insp_clear_waypoints:`Remove %s waypoint(s)`,insp_color:`Colour`,insp_color_forward:`Colour, forward`,insp_color_hint:`Without a colour, a connection takes the colour of wherever the energy comes from.`,insp_color_reverse:`Colour, reverse`,insp_color_scale:`Colour by value`,insp_color_scale_hint:`E.g. the electricity price: green when cheap, red when expensive. The lines take the colour too.`,insp_color_scale_max:`Red at`,insp_color_scale_min:`Green at`,insp_color_scale_source:`Value for the colour`,insp_connection:`Connection`,insp_counts:`%s nodes, %s connections`,insp_curve:`Shape`,insp_decimals:`Decimals`,insp_default_option:`Default (%s)`,insp_defaults:`Defaults for all elements`,insp_delete_edge:`Delete connection`,insp_delete_node:`Delete node`,insp_delete_nodes:`Delete the selected nodes`,insp_diagram:`Diagram`,insp_display:`Show as`,insp_display_none_hint:`Only the symbol and the label. The value is still read: rules, the fill level, the key figures and the worked out flow all use it.`,insp_edge:`Connection`,insp_energy_today:`Show energy of today`,insp_energy_today_src:`Counter of the day`,insp_energy_today_src_hint:`Read from this state, in the unit of its object (kWh without one). Empty: computed from the history adapter.`,insp_energ